{"id":"n25004-1-7","stage":2,"title":"저리 · 往那边","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n25004-1-7-1","ko":"여기서 텔레비전 좀 볼게요.","zh":"我在这儿看看电视吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"여기서","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"여기：这里，这儿；서：에서 的缩略，表示动作地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17863","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"텔레비전","meaning":"电视，电视机","explanation":"텔레비전：电视，电视机","readings":[{"term":"텔레비전","audio":"/audio/f5472a609d9fa7b0176c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27373","senseId":"1","lemma":"텔레비전","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"볼게요.","meaning":"看，观看，观赏","explanation":"보다：看，观看，观赏；ㄹ게요：向对方礼貌地表达自己的决定或承诺。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"2","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c13089162f79c617","term":"여기","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3","entryId":"17863","definition":"指代与说话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["여기"]},{"id":"f5472a609d9fa7b0","term":"텔레비전","zh":"电视，电视机","audio":"/audio/f5472a609d9fa7b0176c.mp3","entryId":"27373","definition":"接收电视台以电波传送的图像与声音后使其显示出来的机器。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看，观看，观赏","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"用眼睛享受或欣赏某个对象。","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/9e5b32bb9e7c47924ed6.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n25004-1-7-2","ko":"어른들끼리 조용히 할 이야기가 있으니 저리 가서 놀아라.","zh":"大人们有要安静谈的事情，你们到那边去玩吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어른들끼리","meaning":"成年人，大人","explanation":"어른：成年人，大人；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；끼리：名词后缀，构成派生名词。","readings":[{"term":"어른","audio":"/audio/00bcc9cf309036598111.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72574","senseId":"1","lemma":"어른","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"조용히","meaning":"安静地","explanation":"조용히：安静地","readings":[{"term":"조용히","audio":"/audio/ae038c58a11863122784.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75797","senseId":"1","lemma":"조용히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"할","meaning":"当作话题。","explanation":"하다：当作话题。；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"21","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이야기가","meaning":"聊天，说话","explanation":"이야기：聊天，说话；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"이야기","audio":"/audio/ffe0179e59e74069bc54.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60321","senseId":"2","lemma":"이야기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있으니","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；으니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"저리","meaning":"往那边，朝那里","explanation":"저리：往那边，朝那里","readings":[{"term":"저리","audio":"/audio/a0dc9f0fa66ac92743f8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25004","senseId":"1","lemma":"저리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가서","meaning":"去，上","explanation":"가다：去，上；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"6","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"놀아라.","meaning":"玩耍，玩乐","explanation":"놀다：玩耍，玩乐；어라：向亲近的人或晚辈发出指示、劝告或请求。","readings":[{"term":"놀다","audio":"/audio/8fc8305f6371680eeeca.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88353","senseId":"1","lemma":"놀다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"00bcc9cf30903659","term":"어른","zh":"成年人，大人","audio":"/audio/00bcc9cf309036598111.mp3","entryId":"72574","definition":"长大成人的人。","pronunciation":["어ː른"]},{"id":"ae038c58a1186312","term":"조용히","zh":"安静地","audio":"/audio/ae038c58a11863122784.mp3","entryId":"75797","definition":"任何声音都没有地。","pronunciation":["조용히"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"当作话题。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"当作话题。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"ffe0179e59e74069","term":"이야기","zh":"聊天，说话","audio":"/audio/ffe0179e59e74069bc54.mp3","entryId":"60321","definition":"和别人交流的话。","pronunciation":["이야기"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"事实或现象存在。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"a0dc9f0fa66ac927","term":"저리","zh":"往那边，朝那里","audio":"/audio/a0dc9f0fa66ac92743f8.mp3","entryId":"25004","definition":"向着那个地方；或向着那个方向。","pronunciation":["저리"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去，上","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为某种目的而向某个地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"8fc8305f6371680e","term":"놀다","zh":"玩耍，玩乐","audio":"/audio/8fc8305f6371680eeeca.mp3","entryId":"88353","definition":"玩着游戏等度过有趣、愉快的时光。","pronunciation":["놀ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/c097a0cb85f787cb3a53.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.428,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=25004","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":82,"sequenceScore":2.2547,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我在这儿看看电视吧。","大人们有要安静谈的事情，你们到那边去玩吧。","今天打扫的工作让我来帮忙吧。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我在这儿看看电视吧。","大人们有要安静谈的事情，你们到那边去玩吧。","今天打扫的工作让我来帮忙吧。"],"answer":1}]}
